{"v":4,"catch":"探索等距地下城，在經典JRPG中掌握成長型技能","desc":"在傳奇藝術家奧維爾消失一個世紀後，西恩與米歇爾踏上旅程，尋找他的最終作品。途中，他們遇見了失去記憶的神秘少女莉亞拉。她所攜帶的事物足以改變命運，將眾人捲入一段關於藝術、命運與隱藏真相的經典奇幻故事。\n\n本作為經典指令式JRPG，採用等距視角的3D地圖與流暢的戰鬥動畫。探索地下城，體驗容易上手的回合制戰鬥系統。前往鐵匠鋪強化武器，每位角色最多可學習五種技能，並透過反覆使用不斷成長。戰鬥中累積SP，釋放強力必殺技與連攜攻擊。","publisher":"KEMCO","release":"2026-04-10","genres":["角色扮演","冒險"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["日文","英文"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"輔12歳級","size":"Switch 2 0.2GB / Switch 0.2GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/3a7e58ce32a4ec706a219d643d1db513224029631a66949d434c17c1f7fe2c2e.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/755e8e22683a47cc8ed41c2efe64510fa77a6351e3c85444dab12a625b283a8a.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/26a19d01ac764f3614f64d137fc868a4006071d6844d10fb6372d1cc75748938.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/8240ddff2210f80f49118fcc1a044a304bf9a521ee24ed68cb995364a94ffe44.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/e11f7cacd549d40b18d3dc609c1d2232917a3f34d41593caf813f56d00fefba5.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/85209fa787e77183b5be2b98d4f599718d35fbe0a86de7a53bb5442288690a9e.jpg"],"titleId":"0100182024bc6000","dlc":[{"id":"70050000070871","name":"Experience x3 - Tears Revolude","img":"c0bc0bc57ca8cb3fcc5fae67c2477d101f41f498df2d9d2e0a0ebf1891fe27aa","date":"2026-04-10","mem":false},{"id":"70050000070872","name":"Skill Proficiency x3 - Tears Revolude","img":"29303ccf7ce39291fbb33097919dcafa4c0dcdac8eb5d3d9114f54e6ccbfa4a1","date":"2026-04-10","mem":false},{"id":"70050000070873","name":"Experience & Skill Proficiency x2 - Tears Revolude","img":"cdc28827260f1f44a75dcadac9090a35f205975b77e3f5a820f2fd5ecdc2e39c","date":"2026-04-10","mem":false},{"id":"70050000070874","name":"No Encounters - Tears Revolude","img":"5ef7a3f9ec9592f64a77fcadbff0d4b3010677ce2b678baf48497828f41f671e","date":"2026-04-10","mem":false},{"id":"70050000070875","name":"Damage x2 - Tears Revolude","img":"a5daf2b832dbfd5367b0050027144d8a2fcc6f70b4151740793c675bad36b